+
+### Supplying a custom tensor adapter to XGrammar
+
+XGrammar processor factories accept `tensor_library_name="custom"` together
+with a `custom_adapter`. The adapter is used by the shared processor call path
+for input validation and one- or two-dimensional shape normalization. Selecting
+`"custom"` without an adapter, or supplying one for another library name, is an
+error.
+
+This hook customizes Outlines tensor handling only. XGrammar's underlying
+processor can still impose runtime-specific requirements, so adapter injection
+does not by itself make an arbitrary tensor runtime supported.
